      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e79b87/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-18T02:22:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I feel like the Colosseum is totally disgusting for Haka to play in. I got both of these cards pretty early on and she had 4 gladiators out each time. So it was 5 damage done 5 times (and one more for an environment target) and dealing multiple targets more than 2 in a single turn for 7 favor off a single card and then I gained the title that is shown off using that card. Then I did it again 2 turns later. Am I wrong or is this just busted?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550\" title=\"WP_20150117_002.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"WP_20150117_002.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"qlfoI5Nsl2QkBkmPKattdDBwuje\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b89f6a1d183e8f992be25014a13363cc118d8550_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">WP_20150117_002.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">1632×918 286 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
