      "raw": "<p>So I feel like the Colosseum is totally disgusting for Haka to play in. I got both of these cards pretty early on and she had 4 gladiators out each time. So it was 5 damage done 5 times (and one more for an environment target) and dealing multiple targets more than 2 in a single turn for 7 favor off a single card and then I gained the title that is shown off using that card. Then I did it again 2 turns later. Am I wrong or is this just busted?</p>\n\n![WP_20150117_002.jpg|1632x918](upload://qlfoI5Nsl2QkBkmPKattdDBwuje.jpeg)",
