      "created_at": "2015-01-18T02:39:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've gained 4 titles with a Rampage, which I think is the most you can earn. &nbsp;The Seeker, Champion, The Indiscriminate, and since I earned indiscriminate before hitting myself, Reckless.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Trust me When Haka dives in and crushes everything the crowd tends to notice. &nbsp;He's the most obvious gladiator in the game, and he owns the arena.</p>",
